      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, @{5e4ca2145f9b3726b3b389e7|full_name}! Thank you for your request.\n\nIt sounds like you're asking for multiple things. Does this sound accurate?\n\n1. IVRCImageDownload should be allowed to download images larger than 2048x2048.\n\n2. Automatically clamp the maximum size of downloaded images to 2048x2048\n\n3. Resize images on a different thread than VRChat's main thread.\n\n3 sounds like a separate issue from 1 and 2. We *could* add auto-resizing on the main thread, for example. Would this be acceptable to you?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
